WEBVTT

00:00:00.112 --> 00:00:06.646
Managing enquiries

00:00:06.696 --> 00:00:13.689
The Admission funnel counts enquiries at each stage: New, Confirmed, Converted and Cancelled.

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:23.943
Click a stage to filter the list. Here, only New enquiries.

00:00:25.031 --> 00:00:28.075
Search by the child name or phone number.

00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:36.187
When the family agrees, press Confirm. The enquiry moves out of New.

00:00:39.134 --> 00:00:43.258
If a family withdraws, search for them and press Cancel.

00:00:54.444 --> 00:00:59.119
Pipeline updated
